abstract: Ying ji li guo xin chu zhong dou qi shu (𠸄咭唎國新出種痘奇書) is a Chinese vaccination
  publication held by the Bodleian Library, Oxford, catalogued as an 1858 [Hong Kong]
  edition edited by Wilhelm Lobscheid (Sinica 1417). This bibliographic dataset identifies
  its title variants, editor, publication date and place, catalogued extent, and stable
  links to the original item and IIIF images, for research on late Qing medical publishing,
  translation, and circulation. It supplies JSON, CSV, and TEI XML bibliographic records
  with Chinese and English documentation; it does not transcribe the book. The records
  were compiled with AI assistance from the library catalogue and digital image inventory
  and have not been reviewed by a human subject specialist; the bracketed place and
  first title character retain their source qualifications.
